## What changed

Completes the first receipt-custody tranche in thesis program #60 without promoting any intake relation into thesis evidence.

### Eleven immutable official-source extracts

Adds eleven in-repo, content-hashed structured extracts:

- three ACOBA / Civil Service Commission records for the Samantha Jones case;
- seven UK government records for the 10DS, i.AI, DSIT, and new-GDS chronology;
- one GSA Centers of Excellence comparator record.

Each receipt preserves its live source URL, capture date, selected factual content, and limitations. The hash authenticates the repository extract—not the remote page—and no extract claims to be a complete HTML or PDF snapshot.

### Receipt custody remains distinct from adjudication

The two state-market case packets now report:

- `receipt_custody_status: complete`;
- 3 unique receipts for the Samantha Jones packet;
- 8 unique receipts for the institutional chronology packet;
- repository-receipt completeness: true;
