### Hard boundaries

- factual thread prose is rendered from canonical case claims rather than duplicated in HTML;
- every rendered claim keeps its status and qualification;
- private dossier provenance remains in receipt custody but is never presented as independent public support;
- editorial axes, translations, and records targets have `graph_effect: none` and generate no conclusion;
